  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Linking Preparedness, survivor-led emergency response, well-being and long-term resilience Maralal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Maralal intends to carry out the LPRR project in the two sub-counties of Samburu North and Samburu East Sub-Counties. The groups targeted would be from areas where there are numerous hazards and vulnerability facing the target beneficiaries. The communities targeted have recently been impacted negatively by the droughts that led to the loss of livestock and general food insecurity in the area. 
With the funds expected for LPRR project, Caritas Maralal intends to support efforts by various groups in target areas to build their resilience, recover from the impacts of the drought conditions and be able to rebuild their livelihoods or improve the household income levels or economies.
The Mimi grants aim at promoting resilient livelihoods of the target community groups by providing them with the opportunity</narrative>
  </description>
